> 6: In x$trace <- trace : Coercing LHS to a list
>
> Highlighted part says "object all_years not found"
>
> So the function does not run, but when I do the models one by one, e.g.
>
> model2 =secr.fit(all_years, group = "sex", model = list(g0 ~ g), CL = FALSE)
