The first upgrade of 'secr' for a while is now on CRAN (the Mac binaries will arrive later). 2.10.0 implements a suite of new mark-resight models as documented here: secr-markresight.pdf <http://www.otago.ac.nz/density/pdfs/secr-markresight.pdf> . These are provisional and subject to peer review; please send comments and suggestions for improvement. Other changes are listed here <http://www.otago.ac.nz/density/secr%202.10.0%20NEWS.txt>. The provisional version 2.10.1 on the Density website <http://www.otago.ac.nz/density/SECRinR.html> has bug fixes and other changes, as usual.
Murray

